GpuAccelerator trait and global registration.

The foundation layer. Defines the contract between triton-vm's prover
and any external GPU backend. OnceLock-based singleton — register once
before proving, the prover checks it at each hot path.

Trait methods:
- hash_varlen_batch: batch Tip5 hashing (Merkle tree leaves)
- intt_bfe: inverse NTT on BFieldElement columns
- intt_xfe: inverse NTT on XFieldElement columns

All methods have CPU fallback defaults. Zero overhead when no GPU
is registered — the Option check is the only cost.

